fferent stages of the game? Is it fun if the AI tries to spoil your strategies? And if not, how can t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-05-11T23:35:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1799088287940693","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3438600-1795917897463145","game_id":"steam-3438600","kind":"announcement","title":"State of Development: April 2025","summary":"Last month has mostly been work on the AI. Here is a gif of it in action: {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45456459/ddd645b86b3eaf5a5d0e27046f34f1c2e0b8103a.gif What you're seeing is the test-version of the AI. It picks a random piece, rotates it a random number of turns, then calculates the most effective place to put it. It does this calculation for every spot within three spaces of a tile. My last month has mostly been spent making, debugging and optimizing this code. The moves it makes are quite good. I s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-04-07T20:07:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1795917897463145","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3438600-1792751526087638","game_id":"steam-3438600","kind":"announcement","title":"State of development: March 2025","summary":"DEMO With the core gameplay now done, I have started work on a demo. I am hoping to release it in May 2025. The demo will have all the features and gamemodes of the full game - you will even be able to play online once that's implemented! However, you will only be able to play a limited number of times. NEW PLANNED GAMEMODE I recently realized that Battle-Lines would make a fine single-player game too. So I'm adding a Single-Player Mode. Instead of competing against others, you'd try to reach th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-03-01T22:46:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1792751526087638","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:09:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3438600":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:40:26Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:40:26Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3438600":"2026-10-26T00:40:26Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3438600":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:40:26Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:40:26Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4335720":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:40:26Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:40:26Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3438600","app_id":3438600,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:17Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"2cc3cc9a79e25700156e7563e6f437644af7bff537c7a87e2f029e8571a2f6df","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Like playing Go with puzzle pieces. Build, recolor and steal lines to dominate the board! Play local, online or against AI.","publishers":[{"name":"Mimas Games"}],"developers":[{"name":"Mimas Games"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1800313200,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Battle-Lines Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1769092517","trailer_category":0,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"3438600/672082350/4434f6d79fdeb85946b2c3a3cc7562ccffb64e79/1769092126/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"3438600/672082350/4434f6d79fdeb85946b2c3a3cc7562ccffb64e79/1769092126